<view class="page page--flat login">
  <view class="brand">
    <view class="brand__logo">◎</view>
    <view class="brand__title">AI 照相馆</view>
    <view class="brand__sub">拍一张，交给影棚 · 端侧处理，照片不出本机</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="between">
      <view class="title">手机号登录</view>
      <text class="tag">F-ACC-01</text>
    </view>
    <view class="field">
      <text class="field__label">手机号</text>
      <input
        class="field__input"
        type="number"
        maxlength="11"
        placeholder="请输入 11 位手机号"
        placeholder-class="field__ph"
        value="{{phone}}"
        bindinput="onPhone"
      />
    </view>
    <view class="field">
      <text class="field__label">验证码</text>
      <input
        class="field__input"
        type="number"
        maxlength="6"
        placeholder="6 位验证码"
        placeholder-class="field__ph"
        value="{{code}}"
        bindinput="onCode"
      />
      <view class="send {{counting > 0 ? 'send--off' : ''}}" bindtap="sendCode">
        {{counting > 0 ? counting + 's' : sending ? '发送中' : '获取验证码'}}
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="tiny" style="margin-top: 14rpx">
      未注册的手机号将自动注册；手机号只用于账号标识与额度归属，不与人脸特征关联。
    </view>
    <view class="tiny">演示环境：验证码固定 888888。</view>

    <view class="agree" bindtap="toggleAgree">
      <view class="checkbox {{agreed ? 'checkbox--on' : ''}}">{{agreed ? '✓' : ''}}</view>
      <view class="grow">
        <text class="agree__text">我已阅读并同意</text>
        <text class="agree__link" data-type="portrait" catchtap="openDoc">《肖像权授权承诺》</text>
        <text class="agree__link" data-type="privacy" catchtap="openDoc">《隐私政策》</text>
        <text class="agree__link" data-type="service" catchtap="openDoc">《用户服务协议》</text>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="btn btn--primary btn--block" style="margin-top: 24rpx" bindtap="login">
      {{logging ? '登录中…' : '登录 / 注册'}}
    </view>
    <view class="btn btn--ghost btn--block" style="margin-top: 14rpx" bindtap="signOnly">仅签署协议（稍后登录）</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="between">
      <view class="title">为什么必须先签协议</view>
      <text class="tag tag--tan">F-ACC-02</text>
    </view>
    <view class="rule">1. 仅允许上传本人肖像；使用他人照片合成将由上传者承担肖像权责任。</view>
    <view class="rule">2. 禁止用于伪造证件、恶搞他人或任何商业侵权场景，系统保留拒绝服务与追责权利。</view>
    <view class="rule">3. 照片默认不出本机、不建立长期作品库；云增强必须逐次显式授权，结果回传后即时删除。</view>
    <view class="rule">4. 协议记录版本、签署时间与设备标识，本机留存一份签署凭证，便于随时核验。</view>
  </view>
</view>
